7.2 Import workflow
Implement a guided import workflow:
Step 1 — Select file.
Step 2 — Upload and inspect file.
Step 3 — Map source columns to approved Global Item Master fields.
Step 4 — Validate headers, types, required values and classification references.
Step 5 — Preview valid rows and errors before commit.
Step 6 — Show duplicate detection and conflict decisions.
Step 7 — Show Item Code/Description preview using the active approved rules.
